# Code owners for the paths merge-policy.json lists as `never_paths`: changes here never merge
# without a human owner's approval. Keep this file and `never_paths` in sync; see
# docs/merge-policy.md. GitHub reads this file from the base branch of the pull request.

# CI, the merge policy, the gate's own tooling and this file
/.github/                 @Javendanon
/merge-policy.json        @Javendanon
/CODEOWNERS               @Javendanon
/tools/ci/                @Javendanon
/tools/quality/           @Javendanon

# Database migrations, authentication, secrets
**/migrations/            @Javendanon
**/auth/                  @Javendanon
*secret*                  @Javendanon
.env*                     @Javendanon

# Dependency manifests and lockfiles
*.lock                    @Javendanon
pnpm-lock.yaml            @Javendanon
Cargo.toml                @Javendanon
package.json              @Javendanon
